# "When Curzon Dax dies, you may put a creature card with mana value 3 or less from your hand onto the battlefield"
# (CR 603.2, 603.6c, 608.2): one card, not two (the choice takes at most one), and it enters untapped. Its first ability's
# "another" keeps its own death from burning anyone (CR 603.10a), so Bot2 stays at 20. Bot1 takes the option with Centaur
# Courser (mana value 3): two cards at once is not an answer, nor is the Hill Giant (mana value 4).

